=== 16_mcp_pause (live-call cap 8) ===

▸ Part A: a paused MCP-connector turn, its server killed, then new input.

▸ Live: deepwiki (https://mcp.deepwiki.com/mcp), 12 sequential read_wiki_structure calls in one turn.

▸ The turn paused (pause_turn); killing its Turn.Server before the continuation.
  ok: the caller of the killed turn gets an exit, not an answer

▸ Restarted as #PID<0.476.0>; new input on the paused history.
  ok: the follow-up Session.run does not raise
  ok: the store holds the paused assistant turn
